-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-center geomanist has-huge-font-size wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-crunchbase-research-reports\">Crunchbase Research Reports</h2>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns window-cards blue-button is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full cyber\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1940\" height=\"2150\" data-src=\"https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/final-reportcoverillustration.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-53294 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/final-reportcoverillustration.png 1940w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/final-reportcoverillustration-271x300.png 271w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/final-reportcoverillustration-768x851.png 768w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/final-reportcoverillustration-1386x1536.png 1386w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/final-reportcoverillustration-1848x2048.png 1848w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/final-reportcoverillustration-226x250.png 226w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/final-reportcoverillustration-235x260.png 235w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1940px) 100vw, 1940px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1940px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1940/2150;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"has-text-align-center geomanist w-4/5 mx-auto wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-report-the-rise-of-global-cybersecurity-venture-funding\">Report: The Rise Of Global Cybersecurity Venture Funding</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center nunito\">Discover how the cybersecurity venture capital scene has grown over the last decade and its outlook for 2021 and beyond.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link\" href=\"https://about.crunchbase.com/cybersecurity-research-report-2021/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Learn More</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2792\" height=\"2805\" data-src=\"https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/CB_DiversityReport2_HopeOnTheHorizon-02.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-47348 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/CB_DiversityReport2_HopeOnTheHorizon-02.png 2792w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/CB_DiversityReport2_HopeOnTheHorizon-02-300x300.png 300w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/CB_DiversityReport2_HopeOnTheHorizon-02-150x150.png 150w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/CB_DiversityReport2_HopeOnTheHorizon-02-768x772.png 768w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/CB_DiversityReport2_HopeOnTheHorizon-02-1529x1536.png 1529w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/CB_DiversityReport2_HopeOnTheHorizon-02-2039x2048.png 2039w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/CB_DiversityReport2_HopeOnTheHorizon-02-190x190.png 190w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/CB_DiversityReport2_HopeOnTheHorizon-02-32x32.png 32w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/CB_DiversityReport2_HopeOnTheHorizon-02-249x250.png 249w, https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/CB_DiversityReport2_HopeOnTheHorizon-02-260x260.png 260w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 2792px) 100vw, 2792px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 2792px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 2792/2805;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"has-text-align-center geomanist wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-crunchbase-diversity-spotlight-report-2020\">Crunchbase Diversity Spotlight Report 2020</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center nunito\">To gain insight into the state of funding for Black and Latine founders, we analyzed race and ethnicity data obtained through our Diversity Spotlight initiative.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link\" href=\"https://about.crunchbase.com/2020-diversity-spotlight-report/\">Learn More</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns window-cards blue-button is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group  wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group  wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/landing_page_spot.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-47373 lazyload\" width=\"274\" height=\"274\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 274px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 274/274;\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group  wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"has-text-align-center geomanist wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-global-fundingresearch-report\">Global Funding<br>Research Report</h3>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center nunito\">Uncover how venture funding has fared globally since the start of the pandemic.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/global-venture-funding-during-covid-19/\">Learn More</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/Twitter_OpIndex-768x384-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-47374 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768/384;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"has-text-align-center geomanist wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-opportunity-indexreport\">Opportunity Index<br>Report</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center nunito\">An in-depth look at the six industries with the highest growth potential in 2020.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/opportunity-report-download/\">Learn More</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns window-cards blue-button is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/image_no_guides_mighty_middle-1-768x768-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-47375 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768/768;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"has-text-align-center geomanist wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-america-s-mighty-middlereport\">America’s Mighty Middle<br>Report</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center nunito\">Investment trends in America’s heartland show that valuable, high-growth companies can be built outside of traditional tech hubs.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/mighty-middle-report-2020/\">Learn More</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/fintech_paid_ad_no_copy.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-47376 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 2400px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 2400/1256;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"has-text-align-center geomanist wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-crunchbase-industry-spotlight-fintech\">Crunchbase Industry Spotlight:<br>Fintech</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center nunito\">Dive into the last decade in fintech funding and exits to understand emerging industry trends.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/fintech-industry-report-2020/\">Learn More</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns window-cards blue-button is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/Desktop-18-scaled-e1584646354766-1920x400-1-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-47392 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 840px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 840/400;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"has-text-align-center geomanist wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-a-decade-in-review-funding-to-thefemale-founders\">A Decade in Review: Funding to the<br>Female Founders</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center nunito\">In this study we review the trends in funding to female founders over the past decade.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/female-founder-report-2020/\">Learn More</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/Screen-Shot-2019-12-17-at-3.22.48-PM-768x506-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-47378 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768/506;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"has-text-align-center geomanist wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-crunchbase-2019-annual-review\">Crunchbase 2019 Annual Review</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center nunito\">Crunchbase took a look back at private company investment in 2019, a year that delivered an outsized share of giant funding rounds, high profile IPOs, and a few big flameouts.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/crunchbase-annual-review-2019/\">Learn More</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n</main>\n<footer class=\"c-footer\">\n\t<noscript>\n\t\t<img src=\"//pixel.quantserve.com/pixel/p-TwB08eqbpsngJ.gif?labels=_fp.event.Enterprise+Lead+Confirmation&orderid=INSERT+ORDER+ID\" style=\"display: none;\" border=\"0\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"Quantcast\" />\n\t</noscript>\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"l-container l-container--lg\">\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"c-footer__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"c-footer__info h-waypoint t-fade-in\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-footer__logo\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.crunchbase.com\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-src=\"https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/themes/template/assets/dist/img/logo-blue.svg\" alt=\"logo\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" class=\"lazyload\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t                         <div class=\"c-footer__col c-footer__browse h-waypoint t-fade-in\">\n                            <h4 class=\"c-footer__title\">Browse By:</h4>\n                            <ul class=\"menu\">\n                                                                    <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"https://www.crunchbase.com/search/organization.companies\">Organizations</a></li>\n                                                                    <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"https://www.crunchbase.com/search/people\">People</a></li>\n                                                                    <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"https://www.crunchbase.com/search/events\">Events</a></li>\n                                                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"c-footer__title\">Stay Connected</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"menu-stay-connected-container\"><ul id=\"menu-stay-connected\" class=\"menu\"><li id=\"menu-item-43661\" class=\"menu-item 